                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Straightforward communication: no guesswork, just clear answers and honest timelines"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Family-owned commitment: we treat your business like part of ours"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-ready-to-protect",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Ready To Protect Your Fleet From Engine Problems?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "ready-to-protect"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-ready-to-protect-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Downtime is expensive, but it's also preventable. By recognizing warning signs and partnering with a dependable service provider, you can keep your trucks, and your business, running strong. Ready to get back on the road? Explore our online part store for fast access to OEM and aftermarket solutions, or schedule an appointment with our service team!",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
